hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"250","Bundar told us, and Abu Musa told me. Bundar said: He told us, and Abu Musa said: Muhammad bin Ja’far told me, Shu’bah told us, on the authority of Abd al-Rahman. Ibn Al-Qasim, on the authority of his father, on the authority of Aisha, may God be pleased with her, who said: “I and the Messenger of God, may God bless him and grant him peace, used to take a bath in One vessel of impurity.” Bundar said: “From one vessel of ritual impurity.”"
